{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> A Thread Between,</strong>\u00a0a single-player, grid-based, isometric puzzle game. Play as<strong> Greenfang</strong>, a robotic spider controlled by you, the pilot. Your job is to uncover the mystery of a shattered timeline, teaming up with different characters across a corrupted universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Handcrafted Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average Play Time of 3 Hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Timelines; Solve at Your Own Pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a puzzle enthusiast or a more casual player,<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0has something for you. With tons of different mechanics, sub-puzzles, and narrative elements, there is always something, even if you feel stuck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles in<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0were handcrafted for a wide audience; the mechanical variety means that casual puzzle players and hardcore fans will both find the solutions satisfying. With over 20 unique mechanical elements, no single system overstays its welcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to be presented with fresh and clever mechanics frequently, instead of a handful of mechanics that get boring and overused. With a focus on quality over quantity,<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0is a short yet dense game, full of clever and new puzzles crafted to scratch any puzzle enthusiast's itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nexus, a pocket dimension crafted by<strong> Greenfang's</strong>\u00a0creators, allows you, as the pilot, to access the different branches. Each Nexus Point is a discrete node, a sub-universe, containing a puzzle for you to solve. With 4 distinct timelines, be careful which paths you explore and which timelines you choose to corrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore the one true timeline?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4030020?t=1762298576","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/060536c51c8ea6653444bb9f3b650838c4bc323b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762298576","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/f867aa9c0448e4fad8e19f2835e10ca5ca199915/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762298576","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/f867aa9c0448e4fad8e19f2835e10ca5ca199915/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762298576","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/3b0338dd344c83ea36b92942e25bc30a.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to<strong> A Thread Between,</strong>\u00a0a single-player, grid-based, isometric puzzle game. Play as<strong> Greenfang</strong>, a robotic spider controlled by you, the pilot. Your job is to uncover the mystery of a shattered timeline, teaming up with different characters across a corrupted universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Handcrafted Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average Play Time of 3 Hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Timelines; Solve at Your Own Pace</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a puzzle enthusiast or a more casual player,<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0has something for you. With tons of different mechanics, sub-puzzles, and narrative elements, there is always something, even if you feel stuck.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/fcdb86f2aff2f93ee7217ac52a8f1267.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The puzzles in<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0were handcrafted for a wide audience; the mechanical variety means that casual puzzle players and hardcore fans will both find the solutions satisfying. With over 20 unique mechanical elements, no single system overstays its welcome. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect to be presented with fresh and clever mechanics frequently, instead of a handful of mechanics that get boring and overused. With a focus on quality over quantity,<strong> A Thread Between</strong>\u00a0is a short yet dense game, full of clever and new puzzles crafted to scratch any puzzle enthusiast's itch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.poster.avif?t=1762298576\" width=1080 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.webm?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/extras/63c362850ba455f373f2a4af9a83372b.mp4?t=1762298576\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Nexus, a pocket dimension crafted by<strong> Greenfang's</strong>\u00a0creators, allows you, as the pilot, to access the different branches. Each Nexus Point is a discrete node, a sub-universe, containing a puzzle for you to solve. With 4 distinct timelines, be careful which paths you explore and which timelines you choose to corrupt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you restore the one true timeline?</p>","developers":["Sluice Gate Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030020/0a5255819808729fbc0c08e9d09763941a58f20c/header.jpg?t=1762298576","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4030020/182279779/f72e11b9d3f57e3d99957e853130fb68d13d7049/1762137728/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762138984","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat